<title>USA: CBOE to list LEAPS on Republic Industries.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list LEAPS on Republic Industries.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange said it would offer Long-term Equity Anticipation Securities (LEAPS) on shares of Republic Industries Inc beginning April 25.</p>
<p>The securities, which will have initial strike prices of 20, 25 and 30 and expire in January 1999, will trade under the ticker symbol VRW.</p>
<p>Equity LEAPS trade in units of 100 shares of stock per contract. They are American-style exercise and settle in stock.</p>
<p>Chicago Derivatives Desk ((312-408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
